-extended.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x220","subtitle":"Violet · blue · yellow — glow · tube · lettering, same rules as pink","name":"Extended neon families"},{"path":"guidelines/color-ground.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x150","subtitle":"fy-bg #161826 with pink and teal hazes · fy-surface one step up · four text steps","name":"Ground, surface, text"},{"path":"guidelines/color-hazes.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x170","subtitle":"haze-pink radial top-right · haze-teal radial bottom-left · no photos, no textures","name":"Page ground with hazes"},{"path":"guidelines/color-medals.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x150","subtitle":"Gold crown · silver queen · bronze bishop · popover edge and label","name":"Medals and popover glass"},{"path":"guidelines/color-orange.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x170","subtitle":"100 → 900 · 500 is neon-amber · 600–900 are fills, embers and shadows, never text","name":"Orange ramp"},{"path":"guidelines/color-pink.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x150","subtitle":"Glow · tube · lettering · link · hover. Pink text is always neon-pink-text.","name":"Neon pink — the voice"},{"path":"guidelines/color-state.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x200","subtitle":"Green = LIVE / START · Red = CLOSE / OFF AIR (exit-sign, never orange) · Amber = seat card only","name":"State colours"},{"path":"guidelines/color-teal.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x150","subtitle":"Frames, rules, focus, icons, face marks; turquoise for hints","name":"Neon teal — the furniture"},{"path":"components/actions/actions.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x200","subtitle":"NeonButton tones and shapes · Nocturne Button variants","name":"Actions"},{"path":"components/badges/badges.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x120","subtitle":"Chip tones · Medal places","name":"Badges"},{"path":"components/data/data.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x260","subtitle":"LeagueTable with medals and up/do